<title>NETHERLANDS: Hoogovens 1996 net profit NLG 326 mln.</title>
<headline>Hoogovens 1996 net profit NLG 326 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERWIJK, Netherlands 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   326     vs  507</p>
<p>    Net profit per share (guilders)	  9.67  vs   15.72</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)			  3.00  vs    same</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast a full-year net profit from ordinary operations of 260 to 310 million guilders with a consensus of 285 million.  </p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			  7.93  vs    8.10</p>
<p>    Operating profit			   573     vs  960</p>
<p>    Financial charges			  126     vs  161</p>
<p>    Tax					    109     vs  286</p>
<p>    Net profit on ordinary activities    325     vs  524</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain			   1     vs   17 charge</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
